<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia's SFE wheat futures trade mixed.</title>
<headline>Australia's SFE wheat futures trade mixed.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sydney Futures Exchange (SFE) wheat futures were mixed on Tuesday, when the November, January and March contracts traded for a total of 18 lots.</p>
<p>November rose 50 cents a tonne to A$168.50 on volume of five lots while January fell A$1.00 a tonne to A$166.00 on volume of 10 lots and March also fell A$1.00 a tonne to A$168 on volume of three lots.</p>
